pinned in the UPSTREAM file of this repository (scripts/build_web.sh,
reproducible; dist SHA256 manifest committed as webui/SHA256SUMS). Build-time
transforms applied to the produced dist only — upstream sources are not
modified:

  1. Asset localization: vite --base=/drawdb/, and the runtime-loaded
     monaco editor, pdfobject and icon-font CSS/fonts are bundled into the
     dist instead of being fetched from public CDNs (intranet-safe).
  2. No upstream source files were changed.

